    "detailed_description": "In the virtual game &quot;Karga,&quot; the player assume the role of a hero defender who joins forces with a mighty dragon to confront the sinister witch Hag and her army of darkness. Armed with a pair of revolvers loaded with bullets imbued with the elements of fire and ice, the hero gallantly enters the battlefield.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThese potent revolvers are not the only weapons in the hero's arsenal; he also possesses special skills that assist him in combating countless hordes of skeletons, giant spiders, and ghostly creatures sent by the Witch to impede her.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith each battle, the hero's skills improve, and his weapons and abilities grow in strength.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features a brief storyline that unravels the motives behind the Witch's desire to seize the dragon's gold. Additionally, a survival mode offers players the opportunity to fend off endless waves of adversaries, determining the ultimate defender.",
